**Routing system**: React Router  
**Route type**: Config-based routing (declarative)  
**Route location**: \`@src/\`

## Route Organization

**Organization pattern**: Centralized
**URL naming**: kebab-case
**File naming**: config-based

## Adding New Routes

### Adding a Route

1. Add a route definition in the route config directory \`src/\`
2. Create the corresponding page component

### Route Registration Format

\`\`\`tsx
// src/router/index.tsx or route config file
{
  path: '/feature-name',
  element: <FeatureName />,
}
\`\`\`



